// Title: Invoke-Obfuscation VAR++ LAUNCHER OBFUSCATION
// ID: e9f55347-2928-4c06-88e5-1a7f8169942e
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Timur Zinniatullin, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-13
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via VAR++ LAUNCHER
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "&&set") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "cmd") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/c") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "-f")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{0}") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{1}") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{2}") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{3}") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{4}") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "{5}")))
